    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>What the kids are up to</p>
    <h2>Our children aren't the future of this church. <em>They're leading it now.</em></h2>
    <p class="lede">Fifty to sixty children are part of Saint Paul on a normal Sunday, and every month they take a real turn at the front — singing, playing, lighting the candles, and once a year running the whole service.</p>
  </div>

