<section class="tint reveal" id="acolytes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Who's carrying the light</p>
      <h2>Acolyte assignments</h2>
      <p class="lede">Two children carry the light in and out of worship each week, on a rotation assigned month by month. If your child would like a turn, talk to Lynn Absalon — no experience needed, and we'll walk them through it beforehand.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="note">Practice is every Sunday right after communion, in the Sunday School room. Parents are welcome to stay.</p>
  </div>
</section>

