    <h2>October 18 — <em>Children's Sunday</em></h2>
    <p class="lede">One Sunday a year, the children run the whole service: welcome, readings, offering, music, the lot. It is the loudest and best-attended Sunday on our calendar, and everyone is invited.</p>
  </div>

